Plan-Id: paperps-step3-calibration-2026-09-06-v2.3-v1
Protocol-Id: paperps-inference-2026-09-06-v2.3
Frozen-On: 2026-09-06
Status: prospective_calibration_plan_frozen_simulation_not_run
Design-Template-Ids: br2017,gs2020,sw2022
Design-Input-Policy: response_free_deltaX_Z_respondent_and_task_layout_only
Application-Outcomes-Permitted: false
Committed-Design-Payloads: inst/calibration/v23/designs/br2017-response-free.rds,inst/calibration/v23/designs/gs2020-response-free.rds,inst/calibration/v23/designs/sw2022-response-free.rds
Canonical-Design-Payload: xz_compressed_wrapper_carrying_design_id_source_sha256_response_free_payload_sha256_and_the_outcome_free_payload;the_manifest_pins_both_the_wrapper_file_and_canonical_uncompressed_inner_payload
Design-Truth-Diagnostics: compute_and_hash_before_any_synthetic_outcome;include_PC_eigenvalues_projection_loadings_z_summary_exact_Ti_histogram_subgroup_counts_and_every_target_truth_by_design_regime_severity
Oracle-Calibration-Replications-Per-Cell: 2000
Oracle-Validation-Replications-Per-Cell: 2000
Numerical-Calibration-Base-Outcomes-Per-Design: 2
Numerical-Validation-Base-Outcomes-Per-Design: 2
Numerical-Replay-Policy: all_regime_and_error_variants_are_clustered_replays_of_the_same_base_seed_and_are_not_independent_Wilson_trials
Transport-Validation-Replications-Per-Design: 1
Oracle-Calibration-Master-Seed: 100000000
Oracle-Validation-Master-Seed: 500000000
Numerical-Calibration-Master-Seed: 900000000
Numerical-Validation-Master-Seed: 1300000000
Transport-Validation-Master-Seed: 1700000000
Seed-Formula: master+(design_index-1)*30000000+(regime_index-1)*2000000+(severity_index-1)*500000+replication
Maximum-Workers: 6
Torch-Threads-Per-Worker: 1
BLAS-Threads-Per-Worker: 1
Nominal-Coverage: 0.95
Minimum-Benign-Calibration-Passage: 0.90
Maximum-Targeted-Calibration-False-Certification: 0.01
Benign-Calibration-Cells: well_informed_reference_plus_each_constants_own_targeted_regime_rows_marked_safe_evaluated_separately_by_design;interpretation_sensitivity_regimes_are_excluded
Minimum-Released-For-Conditional-Coverage: 1000
Maximum-Well-Informed-Interval-Median-Ratio-To-Oracle: 1.25
Maximum-Well-Informed-Interval-P90-Ratio-To-Oracle: 2.0
Validation-Monte-Carlo-Interval: two_sided_wilson_95_percent
Validation-Coverage-Criterion: within_each_design_well_informed_unconditional_and_release_conditional_point_estimates_must_lie_in_closed_interval_[0.94,0.96]_and_95_percent_Wilson_intervals_must_contain_0.95
Validation-Benign-Passage-Criterion: point_estimate_at_least_0.90_and_95_percent_wilson_lower_bound_at_least_0.88
Validation-Targeted-False-Certification-Criterion: within_each_design_oracle_point_estimate_at_most_0.01_and_95_percent_Wilson_upper_bound_at_most_0.02;numerical_replays_report_paired_clustered_detection_with_no_Wilson_claim
False-Certification-Denominator: only_rows_marked_unsafe_in_the_frozen_severity_registry;safe_and_transition_rows_are_excluded
Validation-Benign-Constraint-Criterion: empty_and_uninformative_point_rates_at_most_0.01_and_95_percent_wilson_upper_bounds_at_most_0.02
Validation-Interval-Efficiency-Criterion: within_each_design_and_target_in_the_2000_rep_well_informed_oracle_statistical_layer_compute_each_reported_natural_interval_length_over_the_ideal_unconstrained_linear_Wald_benchmark_2*z_0.975*SE_or_the_exact_Fieller_oracle_benchmark_for_a_ratio;require_the_ratio_median_at_most_1.25_and_type8_p90_at_most_2.0;fewer_than_1000_released_replications_fails_conditional_coverage
Validation-Numerical-Completion-Criterion: all_independent_base_fits_and_clustered_replays_finite;every_targeted_error_replay_worse_than_its_matched_reference_on_its_primary_metric;no_replay_count_treated_as_independent
Transport-Validation-Criterion: one_untouched_validation_base_per_design_runs_exact_5_outer_by_2_inner_folds_3_starts_GH31_to_GH61_and_9999_common_respondent_multipliers
Candidate-Grid: observed_finite_metric_values_only_with_the_frozen_inclusive_comparator
Threshold-Rule: maximize_benign_passage_subject_to_minimum_benign_passage_and_maximum_targeted_false_certification_then_minimize_false_certification_then_choose_stricter_cutoff
Joint-Threshold-Rule: first_select_all_26_constants_independently_then_apply_the_complete_vector_without_retuning;require_per_design_joint_benign_passage_at_least_0.90_and_per_design_targeted_false_certification_at_most_0.01_or_declare_infeasible
Threshold-Equality-Policy: comparator_equality_passes_with_exact_double_comparison_and_no_hidden_tolerance
Boundary-Alias-Policy: no_cross_constant_aliases;all_26_constants_are_selected_independently;metric_equal_to_its_own_cutoff_passes
Executable-DGP-Registry: inference-v2.3-step3-dgp-registry.csv
Severity-Registry: inference-v2.3-step3-severity-registry.csv
Target-Registry: inference-v2.3-step3-target-registry.csv
Operating-Characteristic-Registry: inference-v2.3-step3-oc-registry.csv
Target-Truth-Manifest: inference-v2.3-step3-target-truths.csv
Target-Truth-Generation: scmix_v23_oracle_truths_using_only_intact_response_free_templates_and_the_frozen_DGP_registry
Target-Truth-Quadrature: normal_probabilists_GH257;nonnormal_deterministic_rule_4097
Residual-Shape-Grid: safe_student_t5_times_sqrt_3_over_5;transition_chisq3_minus_3_over_sqrt_6;unsafe_equal_half_mixture_Normal_minus0.85_variance0.2775_and_Normal_plus0.85_variance0.2775
Target-Truth-Serialization: CSV_with_17_significant_digits_and_whole_file_SHA256_recorded_before_any_outcome_generation
Serial-Dependence-Mechanism: stationary_Gaussian_AR1_copula_across_tasks_with_choice_indicator_1_if_Phi(copula_normal)_is_at_most_the_task_marginal_logit_probability;this_preserves_every_task_marginal_logit
Informative-Completion-Mechanism: duplicated_finite_population_PPS_with_replacement_within_each_exact_Ti_stratum_using_frozen_latent_and_difficulty_log_weights;the_selected_sample_preserves_the_designs_exact_Ti_histogram
Design-Whitelist-Files: br2017-design-whitelist.dcf,gs2020-design-whitelist.dcf,sw2022-design-whitelist.dcf
Production-Rank-Scope: q1_only
Q2-Sentinel-Policy: q2_is_sensitivity_only_and_must_run_signed_tensor_integration_sentinels_but_cannot_inherit_the_q1_manifest
Q2-Integration-Sentinels: tensor_GH5_squared_to_GH9_squared;GH9_squared_to_GH15_squared;gold_GH25_squared
G006-Compound-Rule: divide_each_applicable_boundary_component_by_its_own_independently_calibrated_cutoff_and_pass_if_and_only_if_the_minimum_ratio_is_at_least_one
G006-Subgroup-Rule: for_each_fixed_high_or_low_z_variant_use_ordered_primitives_a=E_i[1(B_i)*p_i]_and_b=E_i[1(B_i)]_with_respondent_equal_averaging_target_a_over_b_constraints_0<a<b<1_chart_[logit(a/b);logit(b)]_and_diagnostic_min(a;1-b;b-a)_on_the_raw_probability_scale_without_SE_standardization;then_take_the_minimum_over_variants_and_divide_by_subgroup_interior_margin
V22-Compatibility: none;v2.2_protocol_and_artifacts_remain_unchanged_and_are_not_grandfathered
Infeasible-Rule: retain_proposal_with_infeasible_status_and_do_not_create_production_manifest
Validation-Rule: evaluate_once_on_untouched_validation_stream_and_never_retune_under_this_plan_id
Production-Manifest-Creation: conditional_on_all_frozen_validation_criteria_passing
